{# The workspace router injects every heavy organ by BARE name once its view is on screen, so
   each one needs a head link the optimizer DOES stamp — vUrl() reads the stamped href back and
   the injected tag reuses that immutable response instead of fetching a second, unversioned copy.
   prefetch (not preload) because none of these are first-paint critical: the cycle trio mounts
   with the overview board's sparklines, the rotation module only when What's moving opens. #}
<link rel="prefetch" href="sector_cycles_china_data.js" as="script">
<link rel="prefetch" href="mm_charts.js" as="script">
