    {{ t('Subsectors are the 同花顺 concept boards (reliable set ≥ 6 priced members); Themes are our curated A-share thematic baskets — both equal-weighted, refreshed nightly. Relative strength is measured cross-sectionally vs the median basket. On the rotation map the horizontal axis is strength vs. the market (right = stronger) and the vertical axis is whether that strength is heating up or cooling (up = heating); each trail traces where a basket has been and the arrow points where it is heading, so a longer trail is a faster mover. Click a quadrant to zoom in. Benchmark context is CSI 300. Research context only — not investment advice.',
          '「子行业」为同花顺概念板块（可靠集 ≥ 6 只可定价成分）；「主题」为我们精选的 A 股主题篮子——均为等权，每晚刷新。相对强度以横截面方式相对中位数篮子衡量。轮动图中，横轴为相对大盘的强弱（越靠右越强），纵轴为该强度在升温还是降温（越靠上越热）；每条轨迹描绘篮子的来路，箭头指向去向，轨迹越长移动越快。点击象限可放大。基准参考为沪深300。仅供研究参考，非投资建议。') }}
